OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Fscattered light showers in Lothian and
OL,7,FBorders. Dumfries and Galloway dry
OL,8,Fwith clear spells bringing the risk of
OL,9,Frural frost and fog patches come dawn.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FEast keeping cloudy skies and
OL,12,Fsome scattered drizzly showers. West
OL,13,Fdry with bright and sunny spells,
OL,14,Ftowards the west coast. Winds light
OL,15,Fmainly from the east.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FEast
OL,18,Fcloudy with some patchy light rain and
OL,19,Fdrizzle, always focused around the
OL,20,Fcoast and most persistent on Thursday.
OL,21,FWest dry with brighter spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
